before changing this file. Do not retell those laws here.

Captain is port (+X, `cockpit-seat-right`). Dummy `glare-coaming` boxes are
not the panel. `flight !== null` is not in-flight on a machine without a
mast. In flight, hinge bodies are off; do not kinematic-follow the hull.
